  <ProfessionalSummary>覆盖膨胀水箱容积参数和低液位报警要求，基于DNV规则、IACS UR E10、ISO 8861及厂家项目指南等直接证据。</ProfessionalSummary>
  <EngineeringRequirements count="2">
    <Requirement id="ER-P084-01" level="1" requirementType="parameter">
      <sysml:Name>膨胀水箱容积参数</sysml:Name>
      <sysml:Text>膨胀水箱的容积应至少为系统总容量的5%，或按主机厂家Technical Data确认的更大值。</sysml:Text>
      <sysml:VerifiedBy method="review" />
      <sysml:DerivedFrom refId="ER-P084" />
      <sysml:Traceability>
        <Evidence id="E-EXP-CAP-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
      </sysml:Traceability>
      <sysml:QualityStatus>
        <SupportStatus>verified_by_direct_evidence</SupportStatus>
        <RiskIfUnmet>容积不足将导致冷却水热膨胀空间不够，可能引起系统超压或冷却水损失。</RiskIfUnmet>
      </sysml:QualityStatus>
      <sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
        <Criterion>检查设计图纸，确认膨胀水箱容积不小于系统总容量的5%。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>若采用厂家规定值，需提供厂家Technical Data证明其大于5%。</Criterion>
      </sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
      <sysml:EngineeringRationale>本条覆盖方面【膨胀水箱容积参数】，来自原始需求「容积应至少为系统总容量的5%」。E-EXP-CAP-001（DNV规则）直接支撑容积≥5%的要求。</sysml:EngineeringRationale>
